mat%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c32e20be61da14d7ca67bdcd3ed2396c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "吉良さんはじめまして！いつも素敵な作品を拝見させて頂いておりますファンの者です。\nよろしければ、オリジナルキャラ2体の楽しそうな雰囲気のイラストをお願いいたします。\n（デザイン・構図等は全てお任せいたします）\n\n■キャラ\n　・イシカサ キョウシロウ\n　・バクチ ザンゲ\n\n資料URLに参考資料をまとめました。\n※恐れ入りますが8/31にURLはクローズさせていただきます\n\n\nお手すきの際にご確認をどうぞよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1UcKGMtCf0mWDSXhJ2_PacPPliQ-YidaP", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@curiko_1031/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a74f5f79/uploads/origins/6a4c239e-71df-46da-859b-a1bce3d0ef7a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1643cded4a3f02a4ed73265ce1f8d030", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a74f5f79/uploads/origins/6a4c239e-71df-46da-859b-a1bce3d0ef7a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1643cded4a3f02a4ed73265ce1f8d030, https://si.imgix.net/a74f5f79/uploads/origins/6a4c239e-71df-46da-859b-a1bce3d0ef7a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3627bf5a76d9b2723a0372a76e71c550 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a74f5f79/uploads/origins/6a4c239e-71df-46da-859b-a1bce3d0ef7a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34665f7eed6f30d18c90df19b7455c0d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんばんは！！！\nきゃわわ冬服着てメイクしてきゃっきゃしてるブレルナ子かにょたぬきつください！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@curiko_1031/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7d967f94/uploads/origins/d30bd2e1-6989-4ee6-9c5a-e069ae53fba7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce6e51b70ddd74c60f3b2cff9ee11ae0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7d967f94/uploads/origins/d30bd2e1-6989-4ee6-9c5a-e069ae53fba7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce6e51b70ddd74c60f3b2cff9ee11ae0, https://si.imgix.net/7d967f94/uploads/origins/d30bd2e1-6989-4ee6-9c5a-e069ae53fba7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a67c3ab9a19d98807bcc23c5344cd0d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7d967f94/uploads/origins/d30bd2e1-6989-4ee6-9c5a-e069ae53fba7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfc92a56782e6c86f4efcb88254708fb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your art! I was wondering if you could draw 3 characters together for me. I was planning to use as a YouTube thumbnail.\n\nUp front is my character ( https://twitter.com/cloubeau97/status/1469158537624498178 ) wielding claws similar to this ( https://static.zerochan.net/Gunji.full.368964.jpg ) with a confident look on his face. You can choose the pose.\n\nThe last two characters are in this link ( https://twitter.com/cloubeau97/status/1469153795846328325 )\n\nThe girl in the blue sweater is to his right with twin blades in a similar pose to this ( https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/versus-compendium/images/c/c1/Asuka_Hanzo_Burst_Render.png/revision/latest?cb=20200331004941 ). She's not very serious so you can draw her smiling. Also her chest is significantly smaller than in the image.\n\nLastly the blonde is to his left wielding an axe. She is very sassy and sarcastic. You can chose the pose.\n\nCan I also get a version with a transparent background? I would really appreciate it!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@curiko_1031/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/53644f63/uploads/origins/eedef306-0d6f-477c-88b4-b8f5d893f476?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1454b1472b1bd53ed7869b3aab999213", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53644f63/uploads/origins/eedef306-0d6f-477c-88b4-b8f5d893f476?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsi